{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantastical medieval world, the world is divided into two major camps, a battle between justice and evil. Which side would you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Medieval</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique units such as knights and orcs, buildings with special functions, equipment with powerful abilities, cute pixel style, and rich content.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting game format</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruiting soldiers can provide immediate combat power, buildings can both acquire resources and enhance soldiers' combat effectiveness, and equipment can greatly improve the combat effectiveness of individual soldiers. Reasonable utilization of resources is the key to victory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Connection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game supports both single player and online modes.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418670?t=1770861056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418670?t=1770861056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/dec803330c47d4d5590f93e3eb0627217f0c77ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770861056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/dec803330c47d4d5590f93e3eb0627217f0c77ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770861056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantastical medieval world, the world is divided into two major camps, a battle between justice and evil. Which side would you choose?</p>